    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pampĭnātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		pampino, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a breaking off of superfluous tendrils and leaves of
				vines</i>, <i>a lopping</i> or <i>trimming of vines</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut frequenti pampinatione supervacua
					detrahantur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 6, 1</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 4, 6, 1, § 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 7, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 28, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 17, 1,
				1, § 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					11, 2, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 22, 35, § 190</span></i>
			.</div>
